    <p>A: no, unless you count briefly working at the college dining hall making omelettes on a Mongolian grill</p>
    <h4>Q: what's the tech stack for this website</h4>
    <p>A: MEVN stack (MongoDB, Express, Vanilla JS for some reason, Node), plus <a href="https://ejs.co/">EJS templates</a> to make building the pages easier</p>
    <p>This technically isn't part of the tech stack but I also use <a href="https://dillinger.io/">Dillinger</a> to convert my recipes' markdown into html, which makes my life a lot easier</p>
    
    
